#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Usually program messages and documentation are written in English. Using a "
"framework made of a set of tools and libraries, it is possible to have your "
"favorite applications speak your native non-English language. This process "
"of adapting an application to a specific language is known as "
"<emphasis>localization</emphasis>. The localization process includes "
"translating the program's interfaces and documentation to the various "
"languages users need and, in some countries or regions, making the inputs "
"and outputs conform to particular conventions. &lokalize; is a tool which "
"will assist you in the localization process to make an application's "
"interface speaks many languages."
msgstr ""
"Obično, programske poruke i dokumentacija su pisane na engleskom. Koristeći "
"okvir napravljen od skupa alata i biblioteka, moguće je da vaše omiljene "
"aplikacije govore svoj maternji ne-engleski jezik. Ovaj proces "
"prilagođavanja prijave za određeni jezik je poznat kao <emphasis> "
"lokalizacija </emphasis>. Proces lokalizacije uključuje prevođenje "
"interfejsa i dokumentacije programa na različitim jezicima i korisnici "
"trebaju, u nekim zemljama ili regijama, što ulaze i izlaze u skladu sa "
"posebnim konvencijama. &Lokalize; je alat koji će vam pomoći u procesu "
"lokalizacije da sučelje aplikacije govori na mnogim jezicima."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:63
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Every internationalization-aware program makes available for translation one "
"or more message-catalog files. The extension of these files is <filename "
"class=\"extension\">.pot</filename>. <acronym>POT</acronym> is an acronym "
"for <quote>Portable Object Template</quote>. &lokalize; is an advanced and "
"easy to use PO file (&GNU; gettext message catalogs) editor. It is a "
"computer-aided translation system for translators, written from scratch "
"using the &kde; Platform 4 framework. Aside from basic editing of PO files "
"with nifty auxiliary details, it integrates support for glossary, "
"translation memory, diff-modes for QA, project managing, &etc; It has many "
"features like full navigation capabilities, extensive editing functionality, "
"search functions, syntax checking and statistics functions."
msgstr ""
"Svaki program spreman za internacionalnu upotrebu stavlja na raspolaganje za "
"prevođenje jednu ili više poruka-katalog datoteka. Ekstenzija tim datotekama "
"<filename class = \"extension \">. pot </filename>. <application> POT </"
"application> je akronim za <quote>Portable Object Template </quote>. "
"&lokalize;  je napredan i jednostavan za korištenje uređivač za PO datoteke "
"(&GNU; gettext kataloga poruke). To je sistem za kompjutersko prevođenje, "
"napisan od nule koristeći  kde;  Platforma 4 okvira. Osim osnovnog "
"uređivanje PO datoteka s pomoćnim detaljima, integriše podršku za rječnik, "
"prevodilačku memoriji, režime razlika za kontrolu kvaliteta, upravljanje "
"projektima, i sl; Ona ima mnoge osobine kao što su pune navigacijske "
"mogućnosti, široku funkcionalnost uređivanja, funkciju pretraživanja, "
"sintaksnu provjeru i statističke funkcije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:66
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Portable Object (.po) files: Each translator takes a copy of one of these "
"POT templates and begins to fill in the blanks: each message is translated "
"into the language desired. The file containing the translated text is "
"referred to as a PO (Portable Object) file."
msgstr ""
"Prenosni objekti (.po) datoteke: Svaki prevoditelj uzima kopiju jednog od "
"ovih POT šablona i počinje da popunjava praznine: svaka poruka je prevedena "
"na željeni jezik. Datoteka koja sadrži prevedeni tekst se naziva PO "
"(Portable Object) datoteke."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid "Editor"
msgstr "Editor"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid "Main Window"
msgstr "Glavni prozor"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By default, the main window contains six parts. The upper-right box is read-"
"only and contains the current msgid (source text) field from the opened PO-"
"file. The edit box just below this contains the msgstr (target text) field "
"related to the msgid shown and here you can input or edit the translated "
"text."
msgstr ""
"Uobičajeno, glavni prozor sadrži šest dijelova. Gornji desni okvir je za "
"datoteke koje se samo čitaju i sadrži trenutno msgid (izvorni tekst) polje "
"iz otvorene PO-datoteke. Okvir za editovanje spod toga sadrži msgstr "
"(ciljani tekst) polje povezano sa msgid i tu se može umetnuti prevedeni "
"tekst."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid "The main default &lokalize; window"
msgstr "Glavni zadati &lokalize; prozor"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid "This shows the default window when a file is opened."
msgstr "Ovo pokazuje podrazumijevani prozor kada je datoteka otvorena."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:91
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The top-left part of the main window shows the Translation Units. Below "
"this, there is Unit Metadata section and it contains comments relevant to "
"the currently displayed source text. In the lower-left, there is a "
"Translation Memory section which shows the suggested translations from the "
"translation memory database for the current source text entry. On the lower-"
"right corner of the window, the glossary section is shown."
msgstr ""
"U gornjem-lijevom dijelu glavnog prozora prikazuju se prevodilačke jedinice. "
"Ispod toga, postoji Jedinica Metadata dijela i sadrži komentare relevantni "
"za trenutno prikazani izvorni tekst. U donjem lijevom dijelu, postoji "
"Translation Memory odjeljak koji pokazuje predložene prijevode iz preračuna "
"memorije baze podataka za tekući unos izvornog teksta. Na donjem desnom uglu "
"prozora, prikazan je pojmovnik sekcija."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:94
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Translation files are opened in separate tabs, with two big multi-line edits "
"as well as a bunch of <emphasis>tool views</emphasis>. These views can be "
"stacked (similar to tabs), shown separately, or hidden. Translation files "
"consist of many English-target pairs called <emphasis>units</emphasis>. A "
"<emphasis>unit</emphasis> typically correspond to a single string in the "
"user interface, or one paragraph in the documentation. The purpose of the "
"first multi-line edit is to display the original part of the pair. The "
"purpose of the second multi-line edit is to display the translation. You can "
"navigate through the <emphasis>units</emphasis> via the "
"<guilabel>Translation Units</guilabel> view or by using <keycap>Page Down</"
"keycap> and <keycap>Page Up</keycap>."
msgstr ""
"Datoteke za prevođenje su otvorene u odvojenim karticama, sa dva velika "
"višelinijskih editora, dobrih kao i gomila <emphasis>alatnih pogleda</"
"emphasis>. Ovi pogledi mogu biti zaglavljeni, prikazani odvojeno ili "
"skriveni. Datoteke za prevođenje sastoje se od mnogo englesko-ciljnih parova "
"pod nazivom <emphasis> jedinice </emphasis>. A <emphasis> jedinici </"
"emphasis> obično odgovaraju na jedan string u korisničkom sučelju, ili jedan "
"paragraf u dokumentaciji. Svrha prvog višelinijskog uređivanja je prikaz "
"originalnog dijela para. Svrha drugog multi-line uređivanja za prikaz "
"prijevoda. Možete se kretati kroz <emphasis> jedinice </emphasis> preko "
"<guilabel> Jedinice prevođenja</guilabel> pogled pomoću <keycap> Page Down</"
"keycap>  i <keycap> Page Up </keycap>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A unit may be <emphasis>translated</emphasis> or <emphasis>untranslated</"
"emphasis>. A translation of a translated unit may be <emphasis>ready</"
"emphasis> or <emphasis>not ready</emphasis> (also called <emphasis>fuzzy</"
"emphasis> sometimes). If the unit is not ready, its translation is rendered "
"in italics. &lokalize; allows you to easily navigate through the file "
"according to the state of their translation. See <guilabel>Go</guilabel> "
"menu for the shortcuts. The status bar at the bottom of the window shows the "
"current string number, total number of strings, total untranslated strings, "
"total not ready (fuzzy) strings and status of the current string "
"respectively. When navigating, untranslated units are treated as not ready. "
"Also, you may use the filtering feature of <guilabel>Translation Units</"
"guilabel> toolview. Pressing <keycap>Page Down</keycap> actually takes you "
"to the next unit in filtered/sorted list of that tool view."
msgstr ""
"Jedinica može biti  <emphasis>translated</emphasis> ili "
"<emphasis>neprevedena</emphasis>. Prijevod prevedene jedinice može biti "
"<emphasis>spreman</emphasis> ili <emphasis>nespremna</emphasis> (također "
"nazvano<emphasis>fuzzy</emphasis> ponekad). Ako jedinica nije spremna, "
"prijevod će biti označen u italics-u. Vidi <guilabel>Go</guilabel> meni za "
"kratice. Status traka sa na prozora prikazuje broj trenutnog stringa, ukupan "
"broj stringova, broj neprevedeni stringova, i broj stringova koji  nisu "
"spremni za prijevod, i status trenutnog stringa. Prilikom navigiranja, "
"neprevedene jedinice su tretirane kao nespremne. Također se može koristiti "
"opcija filtriranja <guilabel>Translation Units</guilabel> pregled alata. "
"Pritiskom na <keycap>Page Down</keycap> prebacuje te u slijedeću jedinicu "
"koja je filtrirana/sortirana na listi te liste alata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To the main window one can add many more sections like <guilabel>Alternate "
"Translations</guilabel>, <guilabel>Primary Sync</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Secondary Sync</guilabel>, <guilabel>Binary Units</guilabel> by "
"using <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Toolviews</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the main menu."
msgstr ""
"Glavnom prozoru se mogu dodati sekcije poput <guilabel>Alternativni "
"prijevodi</guilabel>, <guilabel>Primarna sinc</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Sekundarna sinc</guilabel>, <guilabel>Binarne jedinice</guilabel> "
"korištenjem <menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</guimenu><guimenuitem>Alatni "
"pogledi</guimenuitem></menuchoice> iz glavnog menija."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid "Toolbars"
msgstr "Alatna traka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:119
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can add or remove actions in the toolbars using "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure Toolbars...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the main menu."
msgstr ""
"Možete dodati ili skloniti naredbe iz alatne trake koristeći "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</guimenu><guimenuitem>Konfigurirajuća alatna "
"traka...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> iz glavnog menija."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:123
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configure Toolbars"
msgstr "Konfiguriraj alatne trake."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here you can configure the toolbars."
msgstr "Ovdje možete konfigurirati alatnu traku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For more information read the section about <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/"
"config.html#toolbars\">Toolbars</ulink> of the &kde; Fundamentals."
msgstr ""
"Za više informacija čitajte na:  <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/config."
"html#toolbars\">Toolbars</ulink> iz &kde; Osnove."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid "Shortcut keys"
msgstr "Prečaci"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:138
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can save time by using shortcut keys during translation. To configure "
"shortcut keys, use <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure Shortcuts...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from "
"the main menu."
msgstr ""
"Vrijeme možete sačuvati korištenjem kratica tokom prevođenja. Za "
"konfiguraciju kratica, koristite <menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Konfiguriraj kratice..</guimenuitem></menuchoice> iz "
"glavnog menija."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:142
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configure Shortcuts"
msgstr "Konfiguriraj kratice"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here you can configure the shortcut keys."
msgstr "Ovdje možete konfigurirati kratice."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:152
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For more information read the section about <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/"
"config.html#shortcuts\">Shortcuts</ulink> of the &kde; Fundamentals."
msgstr ""
"Za više informacija čitajte na <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/config."
"html#shortcuts\">Shortcuts</ulink>  &kde; Osnove."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:156
#, no-c-format
msgid "General Tips"
msgstr "Strategije i savjeti"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:157
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are doing translations for &kde;, then either you will already have "
"&lokalize; project file in your language folder (usually named "
"<filename>index.lokalize</filename>), or you can select "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Project</guimenu><guimenuitem>Create new project</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> and the wizard will download translation files for "
"your language and will create project for you."
msgstr ""
"Ako prevodite za &kde;, onda ćete imati  &lokalize; projekt datoteku u vašem "
"jezičkom direktoriju (obično nazvanom <filename>index.lokalize</filename>), "
"ili možete ići na <menuchoice><guimenu>Projekt</guimenu><guimenuitem>Kreiraj "
"novi projekt</guimenuitem></menuchoice> i čarobnjak će preuzeti datoteke za "
"prevođenje za vaš jezik i kreirat će projekat za vas."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:164
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is recommended that you get used to the keyboard shortcuts instead of the "
"menus and toolbars for increased productivity. For example, use the "
"<keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>L</keycap></keycombo> to focus <guilabel>Quick "
"search</guilabel> input line to filter the unit list in "
"<guilabel>Translation Units</guilabel> view. Once you are done, press "
"<keycap>Page Down</keycap> to start moving along the filtered list."
msgstr ""
"Preporučeno je da se koriste kratice na tastaturi umjesto menija i alatnih "
"traka da se poveća produktivnost. Naprimjer, koristite <keycombo>&Ctrl;"
"<keycap>L</keycap></keycombo> fokusirati <guilabel>Brza pretraka</guilabel> "
"umetnuta linija u filter jedinice <guilabel>Prevodilačka jedinica</guilabel> "
"pogled. Kada završite, pritisnite <keycap>Page Down</keycap> da se počnete "
"kretati unutar filtrirane liste."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:172
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are working with translation files in XLIFF format (definitely the "
"case when you translate OpenDocument), then extended states are available "
"(<emphasis>new</emphasis>, <emphasis>needs review</emphasis>, "
"<emphasis>approved</emphasis>, &etc;). You may select them in drop-down menu "
"of <guilabel>Approved</guilabel> button in the toolbar. Classification of "
"the state as <emphasis>ready</emphasis> or <emphasis>not ready</emphasis> "
"depends on the current <emphasis>workflow phase</emphasis> "
"(<emphasis>translation</emphasis>, <emphasis>review</emphasis>, "
"<emphasis>approval</emphasis>). A default phase for you depends on your "
"<emphasis>role</emphasis> in the project (set in project settings). Each "
"unit usually contains information about phase it was changed last time, and "
"for each phase its owner is logged to the file."
msgstr ""
"Ako radite sa datotekama koji su XLIFF formatu (slučaj kada prevodite "
"OpenDocument-e), onda su dostupna proširena stanja  (<emphasis>novi</"
"emphasis>, <emphasis>potreban  pregled</emphasis>, <emphasis>dozvoljeno</"
"emphasis>, &etc;). Možete ih izabrati u padajućem izborniku <guilabel> "
"Odobrena </guilabel> gumb na alatnoj traci. Klasifikacija stanja kao "
"<emphasis> spremna </emphasis> ili <emphasis> nije spremna </emphasis> ovisi "
"o trenutnom <emphasis> prebukiranoj fazi </emphasis> (<emphasis> prijevod </"
"emphasis>, <emphasis> pregleda </emphasis>, <emphasis> odobrenja </"
"emphasis>). Podrazumijevane faze za vas ovise o vašim <emphasis> uloga </"
"emphasis> u projektu (postavljen u postavkama projekta). Svaka jedinica "
"obično sadrži informacije o fazi u kojoj je promijenjena zadnji put, i za "
"svaku fazu, njen vlasnik je prijavljen u datoteku."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:186
#, no-c-format
msgid "Projects"
msgstr "Projekti"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:189
#, no-c-format
msgid "General Notes"
msgstr "Generalni Zapisi"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:190
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The projects are one of the main concepts in &lokalize;. A project is "
"represented by a file that contains paths, folders with translations, "
"templates, and other files: glossary file, automation scripts, translation "
"memories. Whenever &lokalize; opens a file without a project loaded, it will "
"search for a project file in the parent folders (up to four levels). "
"Alternatively, you can specify the project file via the <userinput>--"
"project</userinput> flag when starting &lokalize; from the command line."
msgstr ""
"Projekti su jedan od glavnih pojmova u &lokalize;. Projekat predstavlja "
"datoteku koja sadrži staze, fascikle sa prevodima, predloške, i druge "
"datoteke: pojmovnik datoteka, automatizacija skripte, memoriju prevedenog. "
"Kad god &lokalize; otvara datoteku bez učitanog projekta, to će tražiti "
"datoteku projekta u roditeljskim folderima (do četiri nivoa). Alternativno, "
"možete odrediti projekta datoteku preko <userinput> - projekt </userinput> "
"zastave prilikom pokretanja &lokalize; iz komandne linije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:199
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For each project you select your role in it (<emphasis>translator</"
"emphasis>, <emphasis>reviewer</emphasis>, <emphasis>approver</emphasis>), "
"which in turn affects the workflow phase &lokalize; automatically picks up "
"for files you edit."
msgstr ""
"Za svaki projekt odaberete svoju ulogu u njemu (<emphasis> prevoditelj </"
"emphasis>, <emphasis> recenzent </emphasis>, <emphasis> approver </"
"emphasis>), što zauzvrat utječe fazi prebukiranost &Lokalize; automatski "
"uzima za datoteke uređujete."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:205
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Translation memories (unlike project files, glossary and scripts) are not "
"shared between the translation team members, as they are created and stored "
"under the user's home folder, meaning that the translation memories for all "
"of the projects are stored in the same folder and thus can be used when "
"other projects are opened."
msgstr ""
"Prevodilačke memorije (za razliku od projekta datoteke, pojmovnik i skripte) "
"se ne dijele između članova prevodilačkog tima, kao što su oni stvorili i "
"pohranili u home folder korisnika, što znači da j prijevod sjećanja za sve "
"projekte u istoj mapi i na taj način može se koristiti kada se otvore drugim "
"projektima."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:215
#, no-c-format
msgid "Project Overview tab"
msgstr "Preglednik interfejsa"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:216
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you start &lokalize; first time, you will see an empty "
"<guilabel>Project Overview</guilabel> tab. Project Overview is a file "
"manager view, which helps you keep an overview of your PO files. The "
"&lokalize; suite will help you to translate quickly and also to keep "
"translations consistent. &lokalize; workflow implies that you start with "
"creating/opening a project. The Project Overview tab displays a file tree "
"with statistics with current project, such as percentage of the translated "
"units completed and the last translator. It allows you to open a selected "
"file in a tab of current &lokalize; window."
msgstr ""
"Kada pokrenete &lokalize; prvi put, vidjet ćete praznu <guilabel>Pregled "
"projekta</guilabel> tab. Pregled projekta je Upravitelj datotekama, što vam "
"pomaže pregled vaše PO datoteke. &Lokalize; odijelo će vam pomoći da brzo "
"prevedete i da prijevod bude konzistentan. &Lokalize; workflow podrazumijeva "
"da počnete sa stvaranjem/otvaranjem projekta. Kartica Project Pregled "
"prikazuje stablo datoteku s statistikama trenutnih projekta, kao što su "
"postotak prevedenih jedinica, završene jedinice i posljednja prevođena "
"jedinica. To vam omogućuje da otvorite odabranu datoteku u tab-u tekućih "
"&Lokalize; prozora."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:219
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To create a new project, use <menuchoice><guimenu>Project</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Create new project</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. This "
"will guide through the steps to create a new project. In <guimenu>Project</"
"guimenu> menu you can also find options like <guimenuitem>Project overview</"
"guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Configure project</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Open project</guimenuitem>, and <guimenuitem>Open recent "
"project</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""
"Za kreiranje novog projekta koristite <menuchoice><guimenu>Projekt</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Kreiraj novi projekt</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Ovo će "
"vas uputiti u korake za kreiranje novog projekta. U<guimenu>Projekt</"
"guimenu> meniju također možete naći opcije kao što si <guimenuitem>Pregled "
"projekta</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Konfiguriši projekt</guimenuitem>, "
"<guimenuitem>Otvori projekt</guimenuitem>, i<guimenuitem>Otvori posljednje "
"projekte</guimenuitem>."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:223
#, no-c-format
msgid "Project Overview Tab"
msgstr "Preglednik interfejsa"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:229
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here you can configure the project."
msgstr "Ovdje možete konfigurirati projekat."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:234
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Project Overview</guilabel> tab displays a file tree with "
"statistics for a current project, such as the percentage of translated units "
"completed and the last translator. It allows you to open a selected file in "
"a new tab of the current &lokalize;, window."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Pregled projekta</guilabel> tab prikazuje datoteku sa statistikama "
"za trenutni projekat, kao sto su prevedene jedinice dovršene u posljednjem "
"prevođenju. Dozvoljava ti da otvoriš označene datoteke u novom tabu iz "
"trenutnih &lokalize; prozora."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:245
#, no-c-format
msgid "Glossary"
msgstr "Rječnik"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:247
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Have you ever become tired of typing the same long text sequence several "
"times just because it would take more time to find its translation for a "
"copy and paste? Now you will only have to find the (frequent) word sequence "
"in the <guilabel>Glossary View</guilabel>, and then insert it by pressing a "
"shortcut."
msgstr ""
"Jeste li ikada postali umorni od kucanja istog nekoliko puta velikih "
"tekstualnih sekvenci samo zato što bi trebalo više vremena da nađe svoje "
"prijevode za copy i paste? Sada ćete morati samo pronaći (česte) riječ-"
"sekvence u <guilabel> Leksikon View </guilabel>, a zatim ga stavite "
"pritiskom u prečicu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:254
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Of course the glossary should be populated with word sequences first. "
"&lokalize; has a handy glossary editor that allows an explicit search over "
"the entire glossary."
msgstr ""
"Naravno, rječnik mora biti popunjen prvo sa dijelovima riječi. &lokalize; "
"ima ručni rječnik koji dozvoljava da se traži eksplicitan sadržaj unutar "
"cijelog rječnika."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:261
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<screeninfo>Glossary view in the bottom right corner displays glossary "
"entries appropriate for the current unit</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""
"<screeninfo>Pogled rječnika u dnu desnog ugla prikazuje ulaz u rječnik "
"prigodan za trenutnu jedinicu</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:267
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<phrase>Glossary view in the bottom right corner displays glossary entries "
"appropriate for the current unit</phrase>"
msgstr ""
"<phrase> Pogled rječnika u dnu desnog ugla prikazuje ulaz u rječnik prigodan "
"za trenutnu jedinicu</phrase>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:275
#, no-c-format
msgid "Translation Memory"
msgstr "Prevodilačka memorija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:277
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Translation Memory</guilabel> view allows you to drag and drop "
"a folder with translation files from say &dolphin; into the view, and then, "
"within few minutes, translation suggestions will be shown automatically on "
"the unit switch. To insert the translation suggestions into the file, use "
"<keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>1</keycap></keycombo>, <keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>2</"
"keycap></keycombo> and so on, depending on the number of suggestion."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Prevodilačka memorija</guilabel> pregled dozvoljava da povučete i "
"otpustite folder sa prevedenim datoteka iz  rečenog &dolphin; u pregled, i "
"nakon toga, kroz nekoliko minuta, prijedlozi za prevedeno će se automatski "
"prikazati. Za ubacivanje prijedloga, koristite <keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>1</"
"keycap></keycombo>, <keycombo>&Ctrl;<keycap>2</keycap></keycombo>i tako "
"dalje, zavisno od broja prijedloga."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:285
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use <menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</guimenu><guimenuitem>Manage translation "
"memories</guimenuitem></menuchoice> to add/manage projects to your "
"Translation Memory. Here you can also import or export data from <filename "
"role=\"extension\">tmx</filename> file format."
msgstr ""
"Koristite <menuchoice><guimenu>Alati</guimenu><guimenuitem>Sortiraj "
"prevodilačku memoriju</guimenuitem></menuchoice> da dodate/soritrate vašu "
"Prevodilačku memoriju. Tu također možete uvesti ili izvesti memoriju iz "
"<filename role=\"extension\">tmx</filename> formata datoteke."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:289
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Pressing <keycombo><keycap>F7</keycap></keycombo> will open "
"<guilabel>Translation Memory</guilabel> tab, which allows you to query the "
"TM freely. Clicking a search result will open the corresponding file and "
"unit. If you want to quickly open some file in the project (and it is added "
"to TM), then instead of browsing <guilabel>Project Overview</guilabel> you "
"can just type its name into the <guilabel>File mask</guilabel> field, "
"accompanied by '*'."
msgstr ""
"Pritiskom <keycombo><keycap>F7</keycap></keycombo> će otvoriti "
"<guilabel>Prevodilačku memoriju</guilabel> tab, koji dozvoljava slobodno "
"korištenje TM-a. Klikom na rezultate pretrage, otvorit će se odgovarajuća "
"datoteka i jedinica. Ako želite brzo otvoriti neku datoteku iz projekta (i "
"to je dodato u TM), onda, umjesto traženja <guilabel>Pregled projekta</"
"guilabel> možete samo ukucati ime datoteke u <guilabel>Maska datoteke</"
"guilabel> polje, što postižete sa '*'."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:296
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The TM engine indexes all entries, including non-ready and untranslated "
"ones. This allows it to completely replace the Search-in-Files feature which "
"required scanning every file in the project each time a search is done."
msgstr ""
"TM pogoni indeksiraju sve stavke, uključujući i nespremne i neprevedene "
"stavke. To omogućuje da se u potpunosti zamijene  Search-u-File opcija koja "
"traži skeniranje svake datoteke u projektu svaki put kada je pretraga "
"završena."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:302
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<screeninfo>&lokalize; with translation memory search results for the "
"current unit</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""
"<screeninfo>&lokalize; sa prevodilačkom memorijom će pronaći rezultate iz "
"trenutne jedinice</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:308
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<phrase>&lokalize; with translation memory search results for the current "
"unit</phrase>"
msgstr ""
"<phrase>&lokalize; sa memorijom prevođenja traženih rezultata za trenutnu "
"jedinicu</phrase>"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:315
#, no-c-format
msgid "Batch Translation:"
msgstr "Serija prijevoda:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:317
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To insert the exactly matching suggestion automatically from the translation "
"memory database, use <menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</guimenu><guimenuitem>Fill "
"in all exact suggestions</guimenuitem></menuchoice> OR <guimenuitem>Fill in "
"all exact suggestions and mark as fuzzy</guimenuitem>. This feature is "
"similar rough translation feature in &kbabel;."
msgstr ""
"Za ubacivanje tačno odgovarajućeg prijevoda koji je predložen iz "
"prevodilačke memorije, koristite <menuchoice><guimenu>Alati</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Popuni sa tačnim prijevodom</guimenuitem></menuchoice> "
"OR <guimenuitem>Popuni sa tačnim prijedlozima i označi kao nejasan</"
"guimenuitem>. Ova opcija je slična grubom prijevodu na &KBabel;."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:327
#, no-c-format
msgid "Translation Synchronization Capabilities"
msgstr "Mogućnosti sinhronizacije prijevoda"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:329
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Sync Mode</guilabel> (previously known as <guilabel>Merge "
"Mode</guilabel>) saves a great deal of time for the editors, and for cases "
"when two or more translators are working simultaneously on the same file, or "
"when one has to maintain translations for several branches of software."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Sync Mode</guilabel> (prije poznato kao <guilabel>Spajanje</"
"guilabel>) spašava mnogo vremena za urednike, a za slučajeve kada dva ili "
"više prevodilaca istovremeno rade na istoj datoteci, ili kada se moraju "
"održavati prijevodi za više grana softvera."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:336
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&lokalize; allows quick navigation through units that differ, and displays "
"word-by-word differences. Also, &lokalize; has two Sync views - "
"<guilabel>Primary Sync</guilabel> and <guilabel>Secondary Sync</guilabel>. "
"They are identical, but the former is usually used to merge translations and "
"second to keep in sync translations for two software branches."
msgstr ""
"&lokalize; omogućuje brzu navigaciju kroz jedinice koje se razlikuju, i "
"prikazuje razlike riječ-po-riječ. Također, &lokalize; ima dva "
"Sinhronizacijska pogleda -<guilabel> Primarna sinhronizacija </guilabel> i "
"<guilabel> Sekundarna sinhronizacija </guilabel>. Oni su identični, ali prvi "
"se obično koristi za spajanje prijevoda a drugi služi da zadržava "
"sinhronizovanim prijevode za dvije softverske grane."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:342
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After you copied translation from auxiliary file (<emphasis>synchronized</"
"emphasis> it), any subsequent changes made to this unit will be replicated "
"back to auxiliary file."
msgstr ""
"Nakon što ste kopirali prijevod sa pomoćne datoteke (<emphasis> "
"sinhronizovani </emphasis> to), sve naknadne promjene na ovoj jedinici će "
"biti replicirani i vratićeni na pomoćne datoteke."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:348
#, no-c-format
msgid "Merging"
msgstr "Spajanje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:349
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"One use of <guilabel>Sync Mode</guilabel> is reviewing changes made by (new) "
"contributors, when you cannot be sure of the quality of the work done."
msgstr ""
"Jedna upotreba <guilabel>Sync Moda</guilabel> daje promjene napravljene od "
"osnivača, kada ne možete biti sigurni u kvalitet posla koji su uradili."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:353
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Open a base file, then drop its changed version into the <guilabel>Primary "
"Sync</guilabel> view, followed by <keycombo>&Alt;<keycap>Down</keycap></"
"keycombo> or <keycombo>&Alt; <keycap>Up</keycap></keycombo> (remember that "
"shortcuts may be modified in a usual way for all &kde; applications) to "
"navigate through entries that are different."
msgstr ""
"Otvori glavnu datoteku, onda je ispusti njenu promijenjenu verziju u "
"<guilabel>Primary Sync</guilabel> pogled, praćen sa <keycombo>&Alt;"
"<keycap>Down</keycap></keycombo> ili <keycombo>&Alt; <keycap>Up</keycap></"
"keycombo> (zapamititi da kratice mogu biti modificiran na uobičajen način za "
"sve &kde; aplikacije) za kretanje kroz ulaze koji su različiti."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:360
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<screeninfo>&lokalize; used for merging changes in translation</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""
"<screeninfo>&lokalize; koristi se za spajanje promjena u prijevodu</"
"screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:366
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>&lokalize; used for merging changes in translation</phrase>"
msgstr ""
"<phrase>&lokalize; koristi se za spajanje promjena u prijevodu </phrase>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:374
#, no-c-format
msgid "Replication"
msgstr "Replikacija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:375
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Sync Mode</guilabel> may also be used to make changes to "
"translation for two branches simultaneously. Set <guilabel>Branch folder</"
"guilabel> path in your project options to the path that corresponds to base "
"folder of the branch, and <guilabel>Secondary Sync</guilabel> view will "
"automatically open files from branch. Then, each time you make changes in "
"files of your main branch, they will automatically be replicated to the "
"branch (of course, if it contains the same English string)."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Sync Mode</guilabel> moguće je također koristiti da se prave "
"promjene u prijevodu za dvije branše simultano. Postavi <guilabel>Branch "
"folder</guilabel> put u svojim opcijama projekta na put koji odgovara baznom "
"folderu branše, i <guilabel>Secondary Sync</guilabel> će automatski otvarati "
"datoteke iz branše. Svaki put kada napravite izmjene u glavnoj branši, "
"automatski će biti replicirane u branšu (naravno, ako ista sadrži isti "
"string na Engleskom)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:384
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For example, if you work on &kde; translation, you can checkout trunk to "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/home/xx/hacking/kde/trunk/l10n-kde4/"
"YOUR_LANG</filename> and branch to <filename class=\"directory\">/home/xx/"
"hacking/kde/branches/stable/l10n-kde4/YOUR_LANG</filename>. Create "
"&lokalize; project: <filename>/home/xx/hacking/kde/trunk/l10n-kde4/YOUR_LANG/"
"project.lokalize</filename> and set <filename class=\"directory"
"\">BranchDir=../../../branches/stable/l10n-kde4/YOUR_LANG</filename>, then "
"work via this project, and commit changes in both trunk and branch folders."
msgstr ""
"Kao na primjer, ako radite na &kde; prevodu, datoteke stabla možete "
"izdvojiti na <filename class=\"directory\">/home/xx/hacking/kde/trunk/l10n-"
"kde4/YOUR_LANG</filename> i grana  <filename class=\"directory\">/home/xx/"
"hacking/kde/branches/stable/l10n-kde4/YOUR_LANG</filename>. Kreiraj "
"&lokalize; projekt: <filename>/home/xx/hacking/kde/trunk/l10n-kde4/YOUR_LANG/"
"project.lokalize</filename> i postavite <filename class=\"directory"
"\">BranchDir=../../../branches/stable/l10n-kde4/YOUR_LANG</filename>, onda "
"radite preko ovog projetka, i izvršite promjene u oba foldera."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:395
#, no-c-format
msgid "Alternate Translations"
msgstr "Alternativni prijevodi"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:397
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each unit may have several <emphasis>alternate translations</emphasis> "
"associated with it. Such translations may appear during file update, when "
"the source string is slightly changed. In this case the old translation with "
"it's (old) source is moved to alternate translations list, so that they are "
"not lost."
msgstr ""
"Svaka jedinica može imati nekoliko <emphasis>alternativnih prevoda</"
"emphasis> pridruženih njima. Takvi se prijevodi mogu pojaviti prilikom "
"nadogradnje datoteke, kada je izvorni string neprimjetno promijenjen. U ovom "
"slučaju stari prijevod sa svojim izvorom je pomjeren ka listi alternativni "
"prijevoda, tako da nije izgubljena."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:402
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When translating software, usually gettext tools are used to prepare "
"translation files. When original text changes, gettext tools update "
"translation files and mark entries with changed original text as "
"<emphasis>fuzzy</emphasis> (or <emphasis>non-ready</emphasis> in other "
"terminology). They store previous original text so that translators could "
"see what changes exactly were made. &lokalize; simplifies the life of the "
"translator and highlights parts of the original text that were changed in "
"the <guilabel>Alternate Translations</guilabel> view."
msgstr ""
"Tokom prevođenja softvera, alati gettext obično su upotrebljeni za pripremu "
"datoteka na prijevod. Kada se izmjeni originalni tekst, gettext alati update-"
"uju datoteke za prevođenje i označavaju prostore sa promijenjenim "
"originalnim tekstom kao <emphasis>fuzzy</emphasis> (ili <emphasis>non-ready</"
"emphasis> drugačije rečeno). Oni pogranjuju prijašnji originalti tekst tako "
"da prevodioci mogu da vise kakve su tačno promjene napravljene. &lokalize; "
"pojednostavljuje prevodilac i izdvaja dijelove teksta u originalnom tekstu "
"tamo gdje su napravljene promjene u <guilabel>Alternativni Prevodi</"
"guilabel> pogled."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:410
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<screeninfo>&lokalize; highlighting parts of original text that were changed "
"since translation was last reviewed</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""
"<screeninfo>&lokalize; označava dijelove originalnog teksta koji su bili "
"promijenjeni zadnji put kada je prevod pregledan</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:416
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<phrase>&lokalize; highlighting parts of original text that were changed "
"since translation was last reviewed</phrase>"
msgstr ""
"<phrase>&lokalize; označava dijelove originalnog teksta koji su bili "
"promijenjeni zadnji put kad je prevod pregledan </phrase>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:427
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scripting &lokalize;"
msgstr "Skriptiranje &lokalize;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:429
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&lokalize; is extensible using scripts in several interpreted languages, "
"including Python and JavaScript. Scripts are usually integrated into the "
"&lokalize; UI as menu actions (to which you may assign a keyboard shortcut). "
"The location and name of the menu entry for the script is defined in its "
"accompanying .rc file. On each project open, &lokalize; scans "
"<filename>PROJECTDIR/lokalize-scripts</filename> folder for .rc files and "
"adds them to a <emphasis>cache</emphasis> file called <filename>PROJECTDIR/"
"lokalize-scripts/scripts.rc</filename> (so you shouldn't generally want to "
"add it project's version control system). RC files also contain script "
"paths, which may be relative to .rc file folder, or to a system scripts "
"folder - they both are tried (though they <emphasis>should</emphasis> be "
"kept in a relative location if you want to share them with other people in "
"your project). For example, you can specify <filename>../../scripts/lokalize/"
"opensrc.py</filename> to load a script from the <ulink url=\"http://websvn."
"kde.org/trunk/l10n-kde4/scripts/lokalize/\">global kde4-l10n scripts folder</"
"ulink> (&ie; not specific to your language)."
msgstr ""
"&lokalize; se može proširiti korištenjem skripti u nekoliko interpretiranih "
"jezika, uključujući Python i JavaScript. Skripte su obično uključene u  "
"&lokalize; UI kao opcija menija (koju možete pridružiti kao kraticu na "
"tastaturi). Lokacija i ime ulaznog menija za skriptu je definirana u njemu "
"pridruženoj .rc datoteci. Za svaki projekat, &lokalize; skenira "
"<filename>PROJECTDIR/lokalize-scripts</filename> folder za .rc datoteke i "
"dodaje ih <emphasis>cache</emphasis> file called <filename>PROJECTDIR/"
"lokalize-scripts/scripts.rc</filename> (ne možete generalno dodati u verziju "
"projekta koja kontrolira sistem). RC datoteke također sadrže skripte, koje "
"mogu biti povezani sa .rc datotekama, ili sa sistemskim skriptama - Oboje je "
"pokrenuto (preko njihove <emphasis>should</emphasis> budu zadrzani u "
"relativnim lokacijama  ako ih želite podijeliti sa drugim ljudima koji rade "
"na projektu). Kao naprimjer, možete specifirati  <filename>../../scripts/"
"lokalize/opensrc.py</filename> da pokenete skriptu iz <ulink url=\"http://"
"websvn.kde.org/trunk/l10n-kde4/scripts/lokalize/\">global kde4-l10n scripts "
"folder</ulink> (&ie; nije specificirano na vašem jeziku)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:438
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Examples of .rc files may be found in &lokalize; install folder (usually "
"<filename>/usr/share/kde4/apps/lokalize/scripts/</filename>) and in the "
"<ulink url=\"http://websvn.kde.org/trunk/l10n-kde4/scripts/lokalize/\">&kde; "
"repository</ulink>. <ulink url=\"http://websvn.kde.org/trunk/l10n-kde4/ru/"
"lokalize-scripts/\">Here</ulink> you can find more script examples, "
"including JavaScript-based <filename>check-gui.js</filename> that runs "
"automatically on each file save (this is achieved via special option in .rc "
"file). If you're familiar with Python or JavaScript, the code should be self-"
"explanatory."
msgstr ""
"Primjer .rc datoteka se mogu naći u &lokalize; instalacijskom direktoriju "
"(obilno <filename>/usr/share/kde4/apps/lokalize/scripts/</filename>) i u "
"<ulink url=\"http://websvn.kde.org/trunk/l10n-kde4/scripts/lokalize/\">&kde; "
"repozitoriju</ulink>. <ulink url=\"http://websvn.kde.org/trunk/l10n-kde4/ru/"
"lokalize-scripts/\">Ovdje</ulink> možete vidjeti više primjera skripti, "
"uključujući JavaScript-bazirano <filename>check-gui.js</filename> koja radi "
"automatski pri svakom snimanju datoteke (to je postignuto specijalnom "
"opcijom u .rc datoteci). Ako poznajete Python ili JavaScript, ovaj kod je "
"samo-objašnjiv."

